# Several chips. Each chip is a thread in the Call Stack. A breakpoint or Pause
# stops them all. Click a thread to see its registers, or to step it.
# The "setup" chip is inline code in the test (no file). Click its frame to open
# a read-only copy of its program.
# Try: breakpoint on the "add", then Step Over a few times. It goes on to the
# setup chip's turn in the next tick, then back here.
alias Total r0
loop:
get r1 db 0 # what the setup chip last put on this chip's stack
add Total Total r1
s db Setting Total
yield
j loop
